WEBVTT

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.110 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll never forget those days.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.320 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
First year of middle school,
beginning of summer.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.320 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
On my way home.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:18.910 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
A passing shower.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:18.540 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really came out of nowhere, didn't it?

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.020 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:24.3% position:55.6% size:32% align:center
Su

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:27% position:57.5% size:32% align:center
mm

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:29.2% position:59.3% size:32% align:center
er

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:31.4% position:61.1% size:32% align:center
Fe

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:32.8% position:62.7% size:32% align:center
st

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:33.8% position:64% size:32% align:center
iv

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.420 line:34.6% position:65.3% size:32% align:center
al

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.900 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka-kun, going to the festival?

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:07.610 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wonder if Yumi-chan's going.
I'd better ask her later.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.180 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Here, use this.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.800 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wipe your hair.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.820 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You'll catch a cold otherwise.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.030 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Is this your gym shirt?

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:29.130 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't worry, it's clean. Never really used it.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.360 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Just once.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.480 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What?! So you have used it!

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:46.680 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Fine then! Have it your way.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.730 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, go right ahead.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.980 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thanks.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:03.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka-kun was in the class next to mine.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.880 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
He was short, and his voice wasn't very deep. Almost
like a girl.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thank you.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.800 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Are you going to the summer festival?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:19.760 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Have you already made plans with your friends?

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.170 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Not yet...

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.470 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Seven o'clock.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.750 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
By the clock in Triangle Park.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.320 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.030 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What's going on with you and Tanaka? You dating or
something?

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.240 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
C'mon, spill it!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.330 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Just shut your mouth!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:51.200 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
This is why I hate boys.

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.710 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Boys should just...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.470 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
...all die in a fire!

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:15.190 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Seven o'clock, by the clock in Triangle Park.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.460 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
The minutes passed by with no sign of Tanaka-kun.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.200 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Seriously? Tanaka's gone?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.940 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, I heard he moved away during summer vacation.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Could've at least told me.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.670 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What, you didn't know either?

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.420 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
He was as awkward as they came,

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:36.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
indecisive,

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:41.670 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
and never sure of his place.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:50.240 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But I was still in love with Tanaka-kun.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:55.890 line:85.9% position:50% size:90% align:center
Even now, a small part of my heart belongs to him.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sometimes, I think,

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.870 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
"I want to go back to those days."

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.000 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Three years have passed.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.510 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I, Yoshioka Futaba,

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.720 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
live a peaceful life...

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.720 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Mom! Why didn't you wake me?!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.850 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm about to start the third semester of my first
year of high school.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.660 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh no!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.000 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Futaba, morning.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.090 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yo! Morning, Chie-chan!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.220 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Here. Thanks for lending it to me.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.300 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
No prob.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.760 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Girl, you gotta take better care of yourself.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.680 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're seriously lacking in allure.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.230 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't think I don't know any better.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.480 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
This is all on purpose.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.940 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're hopeless, Futaba.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.450 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But that's what I like about Futaba!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.490 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yo! Morning, Asumi!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.990 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're nothing like that.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.660 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Makita, good morning.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.620 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hello.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:41.000 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Look at 'em slobbering all over her.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.500 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
She's not even all that pretty, either.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.840 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
They just like the idea of her.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.970 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Makita Yuuri. Is she fine with the way things are?

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:56.020 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
All the girls in class hate and ostracize her.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.640 line:7.9% position:50% size:90% align:center
Just looking at her pisses me off.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.770 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I wouldn't be able to take it.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.810 line:7.9% position:50% size:90% align:center
She acts all cutesy in front of the boys.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.980 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
That was my life the last two years of middle
school.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.270 line:7.9% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, right? Just because she's a little pretty...

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.440 line:7.9% position:50% size:90% align:center
She's the worst.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I didn't want to be alone.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
So I made my decision.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:12.200 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
With the clean slate I received at high school, I
remade myself as a brand-new Futaba!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.870 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I wanted the girls to like me, so I took all the
allure I had and killed it, killed it,

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.080 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
killed it!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.540 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm starving! Let's go eat already!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.040 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You sure love stuffing yourself.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You blow my mind every day, Futaba.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.340 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Want some gum?

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.350 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Come on, I told you to call me "Sensei"!

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.810 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
So you want some or not?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.730 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Give it.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.400 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What's this I smell? Love?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:48.990 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?!

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:54.410 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're not fooling anyone! You've never shown any
interest in guys, and now you're going gaga over
Tanaka-sensei!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.450 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey, come on! I don't...

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.330 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
We're just kidding. Love and you mix like oil and
water.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, never in a million years.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:11.010 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Dude, don't you think Yoshioka
from Class 2's kinda cute?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.930 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
No, stop it!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.640 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I guess, but isn't she...

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:15.720 line:88% position:76.5% size:32% align:center
Bulky Beef Bun

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Now, behold!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:15.850 line:56.4% position:62.1% size:32% align:center
Bulky Beef Bun

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:15.970 line:42.9% position:53.1% size:32% align:center
Bulky Beef Bun

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:16.100 line:31.6% position:42.9% size:32% align:center
Bulky Beef Bun

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:16.390 line:31.4% position:45.8% size:32% align:center
Bulky Beef Bun

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.810 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
The heck are you doing?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.770 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, never mind.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.270 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
See?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.110 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Did you hear those guys?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:32.320 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Futaba, I be you'd be drowning in boys if you
cleaned up a bit.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.570 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Please, like I care about that.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.830 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You know I hate guys.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.750 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
As long as I've got you two, guys can all just—

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.760 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What unflattering bread.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.190 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka-kun?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.570 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Futaba, let's go.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.900 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
There's something I forgot to buy.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.950 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.280 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sorry, I'll be right there.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:26.830 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
His voice and height are completely different...

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.290 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I didn't even see his face...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:35.170 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Why am I so convinced that he's Tanaka-kun?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.690 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Mabuchi!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.750 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Mabuchi, buying lunch now?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.670 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
"Mabuchi"?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.250 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll tag along.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.970 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It wasn't him.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.060 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Good thing I didn't try to talk to him.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:34.570 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Though the fake Tanaka-kun did smirk when our eyes
met.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:40.450 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
And judging from his blue shoes, he's a first-year
like me.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.580 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't believe myself.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.870 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Why would I even think he was Tanaka-kun?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.050 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Ah!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:03.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm not following you or anything!
We just happen to be going the same way!

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.270 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I-I messed up.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:25.780 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really, I'm not following him.
I just happen to live this way.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.540 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh? Just a minute here...

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.080 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wait, did he live in the same neighborhood as me?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.350 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really came out of nowhere, didn't it?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.530 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I knew it...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I knew it!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I knew it!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.960 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Ta... Tanaka-kun?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.970 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
My name's Mabuchi.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.140 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sorry! I thought you were someone else.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.770 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really came out of nowhere, didn't it?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.010 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
So you are Tanaka-kun!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.090 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Well, not anymore.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.720 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm Mabuchi Kou now.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.100 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
After my parents divorced,

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.430 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
my name changed.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.560 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
His voice, his height,

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.900 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
and even his name have changed.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.150 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But still...

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.700 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
The person before my eyes right now

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:30.910 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
is the first boy I ever loved.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:38.250 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You didn't realize who I was for two whole
semesters.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.300 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I knew you'd get it eventually,

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.170 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
but I didn't expect it to take this long.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.340 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're a riot.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.680 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Is this how these things usually go?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:53.560 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I recognized you right away,
even with how you turned out.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.980 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What are you implying?!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.560 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're certainly not the quiet girl I used to know.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:03.230 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I-If you knew, you should've said something sooner!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.690 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
And you've changed just as much as me, Tanaka-kun!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.360 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I told you, I'm not Tanaka anymore.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.450 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
My damn name's Mabuchi.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:14.330 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Geez... have I ever met such a scary person?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Not like I'm one to talk...

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.580 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Well, putting that aside,

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.040 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
wanna go for a reunion hug?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.380 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Come.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
No! Who even thinks of that?!

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.260 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What do you mean, "come"?!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.060 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I almost forgot.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:37.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You've always had it out for guys.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.730 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I guess that hasn't changed.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Boys should just all die in a fire!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.070 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, I hate them.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.200 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Always have.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.910 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But...

00:14:54.870 --> 00:15:00.710 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
kudarizaka fumikiri made

00:14:54.870 --> 00:15:00.710 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Before I knew it, I had run

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.080 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're an exception.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.080 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I never got to tell you.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:05.710 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
atashi wa muchuu de hashitta

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:05.710 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
all the way down to the train tracks.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:11.390 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
kono koi wo saegiru you ni

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:11.390 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
What I found was a train departing,

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.010 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
So that's... how it was.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:16.270 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
densha wa sugisatta

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:16.270 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
taking my love with it.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.100 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Same here.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:21.940 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
tooi hi no kioku umi no kagayaki

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:21.940 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Distant memories, shining seas.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.770 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I... really did...

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.820 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
kisetsu wa meguru

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.820 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Seasons pass.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:25.980 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
...love you.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:29.190 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:29.190 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Now, I squint up at the clouds.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:34.580 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
chiisaku yureta himawari

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:34.580 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
A sunflower swayed in the breeze,

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.740 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
This feels just like those days I've longed for...

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:40.960 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
sayonara mo ienai mata

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:40.960 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.540 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can go back...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:50.800 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:50.800 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.890 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
We can never go back.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:56.350 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:56.350 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
If only the summer fireworks

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.020 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Things have changed since then.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:02.270 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
namida no saki ni utsureba

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:02.270 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
had appeared before my tears...

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.180 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Both for you and for me.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.770 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's all in the past now.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:07.690 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
I will kitto omoidasu wa

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:07.690 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
I will definitely remember.

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:19.450 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:19.450 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:14.620 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
This must be his way of telling me to forget about
it.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.040 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Come on, don't cry on me now.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:22.960 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Stupid.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.330 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Later.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:29.090 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But even as he spoke such uncaring words,

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:33.970 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
chiisaku yureta himawari

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:33.970 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
A sunflower swayed in the breeze.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.050 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I heard a tinge of sadness in his voice.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:40.310 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
ano hi no mama no atashi wa

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:40.310 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Back then, I couldn't even

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.470 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Or at least I think so.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:45.060 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
nobita maegami mo mitometaku nai

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:45.060 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
accept seeing my bangs grow.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.150 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Back then, I didn't know.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:51.990 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
nani mo kawattenai

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:51.990 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
I haven't changed at all.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.660 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I thought that I'd be able to talk it out with
Tanaka-kun after summer vacation.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:57.870 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
kaze no oto ni furikaeru

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:57.870 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
Hearing something, I look behind me,

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.240 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I thought there'd be plenty of chances to come.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:04.290 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
kyou mo mata mitsukerarenai

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:04.290 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
but it turns out it was just the wind again.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.330 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But...

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.590 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
I will sotto negatte miru

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.590 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
I will make a wish,

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:21.680 line:5.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:21.680 line:11.1% position:93.9% size:44% align:end
that you'll realize that I am here, waiting for you.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.260 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
We can never go back.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.220 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Things have changed since then.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.600 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Why does this bother me so much?!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.570 line:68.3% position:49.8% size:32% align:center
School Shop

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.360 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Over here!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.570 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Excuse me!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:33.900 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
A sweet bean bun, a croquet, and a Danish!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.240 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
That again?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.110 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Can you even eat all that?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.870 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I know, right? Doesn't it disgust you?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.660 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wh-Who cares? It's my choice.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:50.590 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
The only reason I overeat is to lower my allure...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.500 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
...but I can't say that out loud.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.880 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm so despicable!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.300 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Excuse me, these please.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.390 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll take this.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.720 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sure, just a sec.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.220 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sorry, I'm all out of bags.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.520 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Give me a minute and I'll bring more out.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.980 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Are you sure?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.360 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
That'll be 530 yen.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:15.360 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Good, exact change.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.450 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Let's see... Where's Chie-chan...

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.320 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Where do you think you're going?

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:24.700 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Are you trying to get away without paying?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.460 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh? But I did pay.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:31.460 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't get smart with me. Those aren't in a bag.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.000 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh? Futaba?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.670 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's because...

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.630 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't give me that. I see you students do this left
and right.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.090 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
No, I...

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.760 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Futaba?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.640 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Asumi, Chie-chan.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:45.970 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What do you think you're doing, Futaba? Are you
crazy?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:46.310 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:48.890 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You gotta pay like everyone else.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.850 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm telling you, I did!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Pay now and I won't have to tell the teachers about
this.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.030 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
If you'd just listen...

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.690 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
She already paid.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.780 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Excuse me.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.160 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yes?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.000 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
She already paid, right?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.210 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, she's good to go.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.670 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really? You should've said something sooner.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.010 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Whatever... you can go now.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.510 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Y-You...

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.340 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey, where do you think you're going?

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.430 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Apologize, old hag.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.220 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
"Hag"?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:29.940 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You messed up. You apologize.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.400 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm so sorry.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.900 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Uh, yeah... sure.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.660 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey! Futaba?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.460 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka-kun, wait up!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:56.460 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.340 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Th-Thank you.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.550 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You really helped me out there.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.600 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Whatever.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.600 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
She's the one who's got a few screws loose.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.730 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah. I was about to snap.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:18.400 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
But I felt better after you stood up for me.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.820 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's all it took to make you feel better?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.780 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're so shallow.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.870 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
And it's because you're like that
that your friendships are shallow.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.960 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's like you're all just pretending to be friends.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's pointless.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.430 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It might look pointless to you,

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:49.810 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
but it's all very important to me!

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.730 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
What? Just drop it.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.310 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I couldn't really care less.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.190 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's your business.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:02.030 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
First he saves me, and then brushes me off.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.700 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I just don't get him.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.620 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Is he really the Tanaka-kun I once knew?

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.370 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, and also...

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.920 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
My name's Mabuchi.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.890 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka Kou is long gone.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.440 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
Just as I've changed, the Tanaka-kun from my
memories...

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:43.820 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
...no longer exists.

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.620 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't go back...

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.740 line:83.1% position:50% size:90% align:center
...to those days.

